# Migration Plan: ESLint + Prettier → Biome
Created: ${new Date().toISOString()}

## Current Setup Analysis
- Using ESLint with TypeScript support (@typescript-eslint)
- React-specific linting (eslint-plugin-react)
- Prettier for formatting
- Project uses TypeScript, React, and has multiple packages (monorepo)
- Current formatting preferences:
  - Semi: true
  - Single quotes: true
  - Trailing comma: es5
  - End of line: auto

## Migration Checklist

### 1. Dependencies Cleanup
- [ ] Remove ESLint dependencies:
  - [ ] `eslint`
  - [ ] `@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin`
  - [ ] `@typescript-eslint/parser`
  - [ ] `eslint-config-prettier`
  - [ ] `eslint-plugin-prettier`
  - [ ] `eslint-plugin-react`
- [ ] Remove Prettier:
  - [ ] `prettier`
- [ ] Remove configuration files:
  - [ ] `.eslintrc.js`
  - [ ] `.eslintignore`
  - [ ] `.prettierrc`

### 2. Install Biome
- [ ] Add `@biomejs/biome` as dev dependency
- [ ] Run initial setup: `npx @biomejs/biome init`

### 3. Configure Biome
- [ ] Create `biome.json` with project settings:
  ```json
  {
    "$schema": "https://biomejs.dev/schemas/1.5.3/schema.json",
    "organizeImports": {
      "enabled": true
    },
    "linter": {
      "enabled": true,
      "rules": {
        "recommended": true,
        "suspicious": {
          "noExplicitAny": "off"
        },
        "style": {
          "useConsistentCasing": "error"
        }
      }
    },
    "formatter": {
      "enabled": true,
      "formatWithErrors": true,
      "indentStyle": "space",
      "indentWidth": 2,
      "lineWidth": 80,
      "lineEnding": "lf",
      "ignore": []
    },
    "javascript": {
      "formatter": {
        "quoteStyle": "single",
        "trailingComma": "es5",
        "semicolons": "always"
      }
    }
  }
  ```

### 4. Update Package Scripts
- [ ] Remove old scripts:
  - [ ] `"lint": "eslint -c .eslintrc.js '*/**/*.{js,ts,tsx}'"`
  - [ ] `"lint:fix": "eslint -c .eslintrc.js '*/**/*.{js,ts,tsx}' --fix"`
- [ ] Add new scripts:
  - [ ] `"lint": "biome check ."`
  - [ ] `"lint:fix": "biome check --apply ."`
  - [ ] `"format": "biome format ."`
  - [ ] `"format:fix": "biome format --write ."`

### 5. CI/CD Updates
- [ ] Update GitHub Actions workflows
- [ ] Add `biome.json` to version control
- [ ] Update pre-commit hooks if present

### 6. Migration Testing Process
