## Notes
- Biome is significantly faster than ESLint + Prettier
- Some ESLint rules might not have direct equivalents in Biome
- Consider keeping ESLint temporarily for rules not yet supported by Biome
- Monitor Biome's React-specific linting capabilities as they evolve

